.TH TENSQUANT 1 "30 October 2026" "tenspile 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tensquant \- dequantize a pack, or quantize with Q4_0 or Q8_0
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B tensquant \-\-dequant \-o
\fIout\fR [\fB\-\-format\fR \fIname\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR]
[\fB\-\-force\-single\-file\fR] \fIsource\fR
.B tensquant \-\-quantize
q4_0|q8_0 \fB\-o\fR \fIout.gguf\fR [\fB\-\-force\fR]
[\fB\-\-force\-single\-file\fR] \fIsource\fR
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tensquant
reads a container and writes float32, or the reverse for the two
reference quantizers.
Dequant does not recover the original pre-quant floats.
A directory is the safetensors weight set, the same rule as
.BR tenspile (1).
An existing output file is left in place unless
.B \-\-force
is set.
.PP
.B \-\-dequant
writes float32.
GGML blocks use the transcribed dequantize formulas.
Q8_1 is refused.
GPTQ uses the 2, 4, and 8 bit cuda pack, which is also the stored
exllama layout.
Zeros are incremented before the scale, and
.I g_idx
selects the row.
AWQ uses the gemm nibble order.
bitsandbytes uses the NF4 or FP4 codebook.
compressed-tensors unpacks pack-quantized codes and keeps the scale tensors.
MLX uses
.I quantization
in
.IR config.json .
.PP
GPTQ 3-bit, the marlin tile inverse, EXL2
.RI ( EXL2\-Q1 ),
and ModelOpt NVFP4
.RI ( CT\-Q1 )
stop, because those inverses are not written out.
.PP
.B \-\-quantize
accepts
.I q4_0
and
.I q8_0
and writes a GGUF file with those reference quantizers.
K-quants and IQ types are not quantized.
The innermost size must be a multiple of 32.
.SH OPTIONS
Pass
.B \-\-dequant
or
.BR \-\-quantize ,
not both.
.TP
.B \-\-dequant
Write float32 from a transcribed pack.
.TP
.BI \-\-quantize " q4_0|q8_0"
Quantize float weights with the named reference quantizer.
The output is GGUF.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output " \fIfile\fR"
Output path.
Required.
For
.BR \-\-dequant ,
the container is safetensors, npy, npz, or float32 GGUF,
from
.B \-\-format
or from the file name.
.TP
.BI \-\-format " name"
Container to write for
.BR \-\-dequant .
.TP
.B \-\-force
Overwrite an existing output file.
.TP
.BI \-\-force\-single\-file " path"
Read this
.I .safetensors
file even when
.I config.json
is in the same directory.
It applies only to the path written immediately after it.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show the short help.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Show the version.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The output file was written.
.TP
.B 1
An error.
The message is written to stderr and starts with
.BR "tensquant: " .
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
.B tensquant \-\-dequant \-o model.safetensors model.gguf
.B tensquant \-\-quantize q8_0 \-o model.gguf weights.safetensors
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tenspile (1),
.BR tensdiff (1),
.BR tensconv (1)
